# Kryptkeeper privilege for kkscan (mode password)
# Install as /etc/sudoers.d/kryptkeeper-kkscan, chmod 0440, then: visudo -cf <file>
# The account must already be allowed to use sudo (for example the sudo or wheel group).
# The password arrives on stdin, which sudo cannot read without a tty unless requiretty is off.
Defaults:kkscan !requiretty
